(label "VREG" (at 279.4 586.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "91cc0198-0355-5cd6-a448-78aa4cd81fc0"))
(text "jank mini 2.2 (hardware/mini2/README.md). Two orders, one board: usb (U2 AMS1117-3.3) / battery (U10 HT7833 and the CELL parts, parts.ONLY). POWER: VBUS through D3 into VSYS; VSYS -> U2 or U10 -> +3V3 (C3 10u in, C5 22u + C6 100n out). No MIDI power input." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fe4f0b65-6320-5cb0-867c-1b538a92088c"))
(text "CELL (battery order): J8 / J9 PH2.0 in parallel (DNP; pin 1 = +, BAT_C), Q2 AO3401A reverse-polarity FET to BAT_P (R53 100k gate to GND); Q1 AO3401A BAT_P -> VSYS (gate on VBUS, R50 10k) and D9 B5819W beside it (stage 2: sim/power.py); U8 TP4054-42 (R51 5.1k: ~196 mA; C40 / C41 10u); U9 XB5353A in the minus lead (VDD via R52 100 ohm = XB_VDD, C42 100n to BAT_N; VM = GND); R10 1M (battery) / R11 1M + C8 100n: BAT_P / 2 on GPIO1 (0 V in the usb order)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.509999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "24dbdb52-8e94-5c73-84a6-2019b0744eb6"))
(text "MIDI OUT 1, GPIO21 (MIDI_TX): jack J2 ring = +3V3 through R14 // R26 // R48 (3 x 100 ohm = 33.3 ohm), tip through R15 68 ohm; DIN J5 R54 // R58 (2 x 100 ohm) / R55 68 ohm. MIDI OUT 2, GPIO17 (MIDI_TX2, the same UART): jack J3 R21 // R27 // R49 + R20, DIN J6 R56 // R59 / R57. Jacks and DINs on the bottom (DNP, the user solders them). J11 (the power switch's wire pads, DNP) VSYS -> VREG, R62 0 ohm (usb order)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8bb1378a-e48c-5871-a0ea-6dbadddcc4ff"))
(text "Pins: GPIO21 MIDI_TX, GPIO17 MIDI_TX2, GPIO16 LIN_DET (J7's ring switch, R38 1M up; R36 / R37 100k tip / ring down), GPIO0 BOOT (SW1 NO; R16 pull-up only; no RST button: CHIP_PU's RC only), GPIO38 LED_R (LED1 red, R40 1k), GPIO39 LED_G (LED2 green, R41 1k), GPIO9 LINE_IN, GPIO1 VBAT_ADC, GPIO19 / 20 USB D- / D+. GPIO3, 45, 46 (strapping) open: internal defaults (3.3 V flash, SPI boot)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "71481651-aec2-5d2b-9ad6-d7270196ef0e"))
(text "U1 ESP32-S3FN8: VDDA C11-C13; VDD3P3 through L2 2 nH (C14-C17 before, C18 after); VDD3P3_CPU C19, VDD3P3_RTC C20; VDD_SPI C21 + C22; CHIP_PU R8 10k / C7 1u; Y1 40 MHz, C9 / C10 10 pF, R17 0 ohm on XTAL_P (XIAO ESP32S3 v1.2 values)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 27.939999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "884b7be6-0ffb-56f7-9cb9-2debf9244356"))
(text "RF: LNA_IN, C23 1 pF shunt, L3 3.3 nH series, C24 shunt (DNP), the 50 ohm line (net RF), C25 (DNP), R18 0 ohm, C26 (DNP), AE1 chip antenna. External antenna instead: R18 moved to R19 (DNP), J4 u.FL (DNP). Matching values UNTUNED (no VNA)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fd5c2cbf-0db1-52f6-816a-730984011966"))
(text "mini 2 LINE IN (hardware/mini2/README.md): J7 tip / ring, D7 ESD, R30 / R31 20k + C30 / C31 1u into U6 LMV321's virtual ground (inverting summer, R32 5.6k // C32 2.2n: gain 0.28 a channel), IN+ at LIN_VB 1.47 V (R33 150k / R34 120k / C33 1u), R35 120 + C36 100n to GPIO9 (ADC1_CH8). AVDD: U7 XC6206 3.3 V from VBUS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "312bb03a-0695-5b4e-bb1e-18f6f5669f7b"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
